WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,340 --> 00:00:05,340
I didn’t expect that you would fight the Northern Barbarian envoy for such a arrogant skill.

2
00:00:05,340 --> 00:00:08,010
I like to use you

3
00:00:08,010 --> 00:00:11,780
I saw it, I put away the handkerchiefs

4
00:00:11,780 --> 00:00:13,780
If you have something to say, just say it, if nothing happens, leave

5
00:00:13,780 --> 00:00:18,340
Fang Yang, I came to inform you

6
00:00:18,340 --> 00:00:21,410
The more than one hundred acres of cool fields that will take you out

7
00:00:21,410 --> 00:00:23,410
There is also the best way to brew heavenly immortals

8
00:00:23,410 --> 00:00:27,170
Give it to me together

9
00:00:27,170 --> 00:00:30,170
How about it? Do you want to give it or not? Tell me something.

10
00:00:31,170 --> 00:00:32,170
What do you think?

11
00:00:32,170 --> 00:00:36,250
Here is the document for you, please sign it

12
00:00:37,250 --> 00:00:42,010
Well, you have to take this young master to familiarize yourself with the fields.

13
00:00:42,010 --> 00:00:44,010
Then help me run the restaurant

14
00:00:44,010 --> 00:00:47,010
Oda the Northern Barbarian envoy, this matter is closely related

15
00:00:47,010 --> 00:00:51,010
My father said that when the Holy One found out, Long Yan was very angry.

16
00:00:51,010 --> 00:00:54,010
Well, there is also the success of the country behind you

17
00:00:54,010 --> 00:00:56,010
I'm afraid it won't be so easy this time.
